Usage: drive <profile> [options] <command>

manage Google Drive and Docs, local Markdown, shared knowledge and search

Options:
  -V, --version             output the version number
  --profile <name>          explicit Google account profile (alternative to the
                            first word)
  --json                    print machine-readable JSON
  --jsonl                   print machine-readable JSON lines
  --agent-json              show control and direction characters visibly in
                            machine output
  --quiet                   suppress optional diagnostics
  --debug                   on failure, show the full error record: cause and
                            stack
  --timeout <duration>      whole-command deadline, e.g. 30s
  --max-output-bytes <n>    largest result to print, in bytes; 0 for no limit
                            (default: 4194304)
  --read-only               refuse local and remote mutations
  --offline                 answer only operations that use local cached data
  --dry-run                 validate command/policy and preview without acting
  --yes                     answer a policy confirmation; cannot override deny
                            or readonly
  --allow-dangerous         answer a permanent-deletion confirmation
  --permission <key=level>  temporary policy override; repeat to add keys
  -h, --help                display help for command

Commands:
  session                   sign in to Google and manage local profiles
  folders                   choose the Google Drive folders that sync imports
  sync [options]            import what changed in the chosen folders, and
                            finish an unfinished sync
  status                    show the last sync, imported documents and pending
                            work
  documents                 read imported documents and Google Docs
  search [options] <query>  search imported documents by words, and by meaning
                            when indexed
  catalog                   browse stored Drive files and folders offline
  tags                      label imported documents; labels survive a sync
  relationships             connect a document to people, projects, notes and
                            other references
  notes                     write notes about an imported document
  memories                  keep what was learned from a document, with
                            evidence; an agent's stay proposed
  facts                     what happened, as a document shows it; an agent's
                            stay proposed until confirmed
  identities                the Google accounts seen on a document, and the
                            people they belong to
  api                       discover and call the official Drive, Docs and
                            Activity API methods
  files                     read and change files in Google Drive; nothing is
                            imported
  comments                  read the comments of a file in Google Drive
  permissions               read the permissions of a file in Google Drive
  revisions                 read the revisions of a file in Google Drive
  shared-drives [options]   list the shared drives this account can open
  config                    read and change settings; credentials are kept apart
  complete [words...]       print a shell completion script, or complete words
  models                    choose the model that proposes memories; keys stay
                            out of config
  mcp [options]             serve drive's commands to an agent over MCP on stdio
  commands [path...]        print the command tree and its options as data
  help [command]            display help for command

